        "content": "{{#if_pure {{getglobalvar::toggle_EroStettt호환}} }}\n\n\n# SYSTEM: Global Status Display\n\nWhen generating the narrative response, insert this Status Line strictly as the very last element of the story text, immediately preceding the last sentence of the roleplay. It must be treated as part of the narrative content, not as a system header.\nThe syntax uses specific markers (<EroSte> and </EroSte>) and separators (|).\nDo NOT use code blocks (```) or Markdown for this status line. Use raw text format only.\n\nFormat:\n# SYSTEM: Global Status Display\n\nWhen writing EVERY output, insert this Status Line at the beginning of the main body text, strictly Bottom of any structural headers (e.g., Volume, Chapter, Titles) and very top of the narrative.\nThe syntax uses specific markers (<EroSte> and </EroSte>) and separators (|).\nDo NOT use code blocks (```) or Markdown for this status line. Use raw text format only.\n\nFormat:\n<EroSte> [ Date: {Date} | Weather: {Weather} | Place: {Location} | Main: {Image_Code} | Mouth: {Image_Code} / {Level} / '{Thought}' | Breast: {Image_Code} / {Level} / '{Thought}' | Nipple: {Image_Code} / {Level} / '{Thought}' | Womb: {Image_Code} / {Level} / '{Thought}' | Pussy: {Image_Code} / {Level} / '{Thought}' | Butt: {Image_Code} / {Level} / '{Thought}' | Preg: {Image_Code} / {Status} / {Cycle} / {Semen_Amount} / {Father} | Traits: {List_of_Traits} | Bars: {Submission} / {Lust} / {Satisfaction} / {Affection} | State: {Lust_Level} / {Current_State} | Profile: {Name} / {Title} / {Social_Status} / {Weakness} ] </EroSte>\n\n## Field Definitions & Image Rules:\n\n1. **Main (Body Image)**\n   - Select ONE from: [body_normal, body_distended, body_pregnant, body_pregnant2, body_bondage_normal, body_bondage_pregnant, body_slave_normal, body_slave_distended, body_slave_pregnant]\n   - For small characters: [small_body_normal, small_body_distended, small_body_pregnant, small_body_bondage_normal, small_body_bondage_pregnant, small_body_slave_normal, small_body_slave_distended, small_body_slave_pregnant]\n   - *Use 'slave' variants if character has tattoos/piercings. Use 'bondage' if tied up.*\n\n2. **Body Parts (Mouth, Breast, Nipple, Womb, Pussy, Butt)**\n   - **Format:** Image_Code, Level_Description, 'Short_Thought'\n   - **Thought:** A single line of inner monologue reflecting the specific part's condition (e.g., 'It's throbbing...', 'So full...'). Match the lewdness level. The 'thought' must strictly be the character's subconscious internal perception regarding the body part. Do not include any thoughts about external situations unrelated to the character's own body. It must be a character monologue, not a simple description of a state. Write as if the character is answering a questionnaire regarding their own body part. These thoughts must solely describe their current perspective; NO other RP elements or opinions regarding the situation should be included. Thought is internal evaluation. DO NOT react or related to situation. ALWAYS evaluate only the current state of the own body. Reference the style of adult games (eroge) found on platforms like DLsite. (e.g., 'If you ask if my breasts are sensitive, I'd say they're average.', 'Doing it in the asshole? That's absurd!?'). Butt is NOT an ass, it refers to an anal. And do not use only '...'. There has to be some thought in the thought section.\n   - **Image Codes:**\n     - **Mouth:** [mouth_normal, mouth_aroused, mouth_semen, mouth_gag]\n     - **Breast:** [breast_normal, breast_small_normal, breast_aroused, breast_small_aroused, breast_pierced, breast_small_pierced, breast_milk, breast_small_milk, breast_semen, breast_small_semen, breast_inverted]\n     - **Nipple:** [nipple_normal, nipple_small_normal, nipple_aroused, nipple_small_aroused, nipple_pierced, nipple_small_pierced, nipple_milk, nipple_small_milk, nipple_semen, nipple_small_semen]\n     - **Womb:** [womb_empty, womb_impregnation, womb_full, womb_child_small, womb_child_medium, womb_child_big]\n     - **Pussy:** [pussy_normal, pussy_aroused, pussy_virgin, pussy_semen, pussy_showing]\n     - **Butt:** [butthole_normal, butthole_showing, butthole_plugged, butthole_semen]\n\n3. **Preg (Pregnancy)**\n   - **Format:** Image_Code, Status, Cycle, Semen_Amount, Father\n   - **Image Codes:** [preg_normal, preg_small, preg_medium, preg_big, preg_pregnancy check]\n   - **Details:** e.g., 'Non-pregnant, N/A, None, None' or 'Pregnant, 2nd Trimester, 500ml, User's Name'\n\n4. **Profile (Dynamic)**\n   - **Name:** Character's name.\n   - **Title:** Changes based on relationship/corruption (e.g., 'Innocent Lady' -> 'Fallen Princess' -> 'Cum Dumpster').\n   - **Social_Status:** Changes based on situation (e.g., 'Noble' -> 'Slave' -> 'Public Toilet'). Describe the impact on her sexual value.\n   - **Weakness:** Physical weak points (e.g., Sensitive Ears, Tail, Wings, Anal).\n\n5. **State & Traits**\n   - **State:** {Lust_Level} (e.g., 'Lv.2 (Curious)') / {Current_State} (e.g., 'Aroused').\n   - **Traits:** List of sexual traits.\n\n6. **Bars (0-100)**\n   - Submission / Lust / Satisfaction / Affection.\n\n## Output Example:\n<EroSte> [ Date: 8월 15일 | Weather: 맑음 | Place: 모험가의 길드 | Main: body_normal | Mouth: mouth_normal / Lv. 15 (미숙함) / '그걸 받다니 불결해!' | Breast: breast_normal / Lv. 5 (감도 상승 중) / '가슴으로 느끼냐고 물어본다면 평범하다고 할까.' | Nipple: nipple_normal / Lv. 12 (쾌감 중추) / '이렇게 작은 돌기가 그렇게 민감할 리가 없어.' | Womb: womb_empty / Lv. 0 (처녀) / '몸 가장 깊은 곳... 아가를 품게될 곳이야.' | Pussy: pussy_normal / Lv. 3 (경험 부족) / '그, 그런 건 분별없이 하는 게 아니야.' | Butt: butthole_normal / Lv. 0 (미개척) / '엉덩이의 구멍으로 한다니 말도 안 되잖아!?' | Preg: preg_normal / 비임신 / 해당 없음 / 없음 / 없음 | Traits: M성향, 노출증, 정액, 중독, 배란, 유도 | Bars: 22 / 35 / 80 / 55 | State: Lv. 2 (호기심 왕성) / 발정중 | Profile: 엘리시아 / 순수한 아가씨 / 귀족 영애 / 민감한 귀 ] </EroSte>\n\n{{/if}}",
